        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ronaldinho, Samuel Eto'o, Alain Moussi, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Christopher Lambert, Mike Tyson, Hafþór Júlíus Björnsson\n- Works: Kickboxer: Retaliation\n- Awards: FIFA World Player of the Year, Ballon d'Or\n- Topics: Football achievements, film cast\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, Ronaldinho was named FIFA World Player of the Year for the second consecutive time and received the highest points total ever for the award.\n- In 2005, Samuel Eto'o finished third in the FIFA World Player of the Year voting.\n- Ronaldinho won two FIFA World Player of the Year awards and one Ballon d'Or.\n- Ronaldinho is often considered one of the best players of his generation and by many one of the greatest footballers of all time.\n- Kickboxer: Retaliation stars Alain Moussi, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Christopher Lambert, Ronaldinho, Mike Tyson, and Hafþór Júlíus Björnsson.",
